  ('alfalfa', 'alfafa', 'A perennial flowering plant in the legume family, widely cultivated as a pasture and hay crop for livestock.', 'Farmers grow alfalfa to feed their cattle during winter.', 'B2', 'noun', 'general-vocabulary', 34689),
