  ('atrophy', 'atrofia', 'The gradual wasting away or decrease in size of a body part, tissue, or organ, often due to disease, disuse, or lack of nourishment.', 'Muscular atrophy can occur if a limb is immobilized for a long period.', 'C1', 'noun', 'health', 38813),
