  ('mamba', 'mamba', 'A highly venomous, fast-moving, arboreal snake native to sub-Saharan Africa, known for its deadly bite.', 'The black mamba is one of the most feared snakes in Africa.', 'B2', 'noun', 'general-vocabulary', 38842),
