  ('underdeveloped', 'subdesenvolvido', 'Describes a country or region that has not yet achieved a high level of industrial or economic growth, often due to a shortage of capital or resources.', 'Many underdeveloped nations struggle with limited access to education and healthcare.', 'B2', 'adjective', 'general-vocabulary', 38922),
