  ('banyan', 'figueira-de-bengala', 'A large tropical tree native to the Indian subcontinent, characterized by its aerial prop roots that grow downward from branches and form additional trunks, allowing the tree to spread over a wide area.', 'The ancient banyan tree in the village square provided shade for the entire market.', 'B2', 'noun', 'science', 39058),
