  ('allegory', 'parábola', 'A narrative or description that uses fictional characters and events to symbolically represent a deeper moral, spiritual, or political meaning.', 'George Orwell''s ''Animal Farm'' is a famous allegory for the Russian Revolution.', 'C2', 'noun', 'arts', 40712),
